<title>FINLAND: NOKIA OPENS FLAT AT $59-7/8 ON WALL STREET.</title>
<headline>NOKIA OPENS FLAT AT $59-7/8 ON WALL STREET.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened flat at $59-7/8 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 301.40 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
